      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why did you mention goblins? I was just asking about the structural mechanics. Can you just explain the actual engineering part without the analogies? Like, how does the bond between the steel and the concrete work to ensure they act as a single unit?",
      "source": "evaluator"
